      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='60' font-size='24' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>Two Leaders, One Botched Rollout</text><rect x='400' y='100' width='300' height='80' rx='12' fill='#f59e0b'/><text x='550' y='150' font-size='19' fill='#1a1a2e' text-anchor='middle'>Failed rollout, next-day retro</text><line x1='480' y1='190' x2='260' y2='250' stroke='#888' stroke-width='3'/><line x1='620' y1='190' x2='840' y2='250' stroke='#888' stroke-width='3'/><rect x='60' y='250' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='3'/><text x='270' y='303' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Self-judgment spiral overnight</text><rect x='60' y='370' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='3'/><text x='270' y='423' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Deflects, shifts blame in retro</text><rect x='60' y='490' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='3'/><text x='270' y='543' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Team learns hiding is safer</text><rect x='620' y='250' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='3'/><text x='830' y='303' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Self-compassion practice overnight</text><rect x='620' y='370' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='3'/><text x='830' y='423' font-size='17' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Names his own cause first</text><rect x='620' y='490' width='420' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='3'/><text x='830' y='543' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Retro produces real fixes</text><text x='550' y='650' font-size='19' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Same failure, same night, two different overnight scripts</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The overnight self-talk, not the mistake itself, determined what the retrospective could accomplish."
